File Index

/useMatch.ts
Purpose: React hook owning one LOCAL match by driving the engine's authoritative LocalMatch (same MatchSession the online gateway uses, minus the socket) — hotseat/single-player get full parity (avoidance, salted combat RNG, real abilities); mirrors the session snapshot into render state. Exposes legalActionsFor + legalAbilitiesFor (castable heals/buffs) for the Arena panels.

/useMatch.test.ts
Purpose: Tests the hook applies a legal move, rejects an illegal action, drives the AI seat then hands back, and reset rebuilds the original match.
